      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "The Barcode class serves as the primary entry point for barcode generation and is returned by the generate() function as well as per-symbology helpers such as code128(), code39(), and qr(). It exposes to_png(), to_svg(), and render() methods to produce rendered output in the desired format."
