      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "scope",
      "text": "Aspose.BarCode FOSS for Python is a Python library for generating (encoding) barcodes in PNG and SVG formats across all supported symbologies, targeting Python 3.12 and later under the MIT license."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.barcode.to_pdf",
        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.pdfrenderer"
      ],
      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "limitation:1",
      "text": "PDF rendering is not implemented — calling aspose_barcode_foss.Barcode.to_pdf() or aspose_barcode_foss.PdfRenderer.render() raises NotImplementedError."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.encodeoptions"
      ],
      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "limitation:2",
      "text": "ECI normalization and validation and GS1 data parsing and validation are not implemented in this FOSS build, even though aspose_barcode_foss.EncodeOptions exposes fields related to these features on every symbology's options type."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "inherited_unit:052.list",
